        "toolDescription": "This tool allows you to retrieve the most relevant professional experiences, projects, and achievements of Ahmed HASSAYOUNE from a semantic vector database.\n\nThe database contains structured and unstructured embeddings of Ahmed’s CVs, past roles, technical skills, and key accomplishments, all stored under the “Experience” namespace.\n\nWhen you receive a job offer or a cover letter request, use this tool to perform a semantic search based on the job description, title, required skills, or company context. The tool will return the most relevant passages or summaries that match the query.\n\nYou should always call this tool **before generating a cover letter or professional summary**, to ensure your writing accurately reflects Ahmed’s real background and uses the most pertinent experiences. ",
